  <spoon:CtClass name="SteamBoilerConstants">
    <comment xsi:type="spoon:CtJavaDoc" commentContent="The constants characterising the boiler, the steam exit and the pumps.&#xA;&#xA;&lt;p>The requirements name these quantities but give no values; the values&#xA;below are chosen to be mutually consistent (M1 &amp;lt; N1 &amp;lt; N2 &amp;lt; M2 &amp;lt; C,&#xA;and five seconds of worst-case evolution from M1 or M2 stays within 0..C)."/>
    <modifier>PUBLIC</modifier>
